"""
This type is used to show if the seller has disabled account-level buyer restrictions for the listing and/or they have set up a listing-level level setting where buyers have a maximum amount of quantity that they may purchase during the duration of a multiple-quantiy, fixed price listing.
"""
type BuyerRestrictions {
  """
  This boolean field indicates whether or not the seller's account-level buyer restrictions are applicable to the listing. If this value is set 'true', any account-level buyer restrictions do not apply to the listing, and if the value is 'false' (default value), any account-level buyer restrictions will apply to the listing.
  **Note**: This field is only shown to the seller (owner of the listing).
  """
  disableBuyerRestrictions: Boolean
