The union type for the **createOrReplaceUserNote** mutation. This type covers two possible scenarios: success or failure. If the **createOrReplaceUserNote** mutation succeeds, a **userNote** container that returns the newly created or updated user note will be returned. If the **createOrReplaceUserNote** mutation fails, an array of blocking errors detailing why the mutation failed will be returned, and the user note will not be created or updated. If a mutation fails, there will always be at least one blocking error. 
