  """
  code: String!
  """
  Human-readable message of the eligibility failure reason. For this type, the value is `It's too late to cancel this item commitment. Please contact the buyer to see if you can work something out.`. This alphanumeric string is not localized and may change without notice.
    
  **Maximum length:** 512 characters
  """
  displayMessage: String!
  """
  The ID of the item commitment whose cancellation was blocked by item commitment level eligibility rules.
  """
  itemCommitmentId: ID!
}

"""
This type describes the commitment-level ineligibility reasons that prevented the cancellation of an item commitment. The `ineligibilityReasons` field contains the specific commitment-level failure reasons, explaining why the cancellation cannot be performed at this time.

**Note:** Clients should use **errorCode** and **ineligibilityReasons** for programmatic handling; **errorMessage** is intended for display.
"""
type ItemCommitmentCancellationEligibilityError implements BusinessError {
