  """
  Human-readable message of the eligibility failure reason. For this type, the value is `You cannot cancel this item commitment because a cancellation exists on this contract.`. This alphanumeric string is not localized and may change without notice.
    
  **Maximum length:** 512 characters
  """
  displayMessage: String!
  """
