"""
This is the base input type used for **itemCommitments** queries. The **sellerItemCommitments** container is used when queries are being made on behalf of an authenticated seller, and the **buyerItemCommitments** container is used when queries are being made on behalf of an authenticated buyer.
"""
type ItemCommitments {
  """
  This container is used to retrieve item commitments for an authenticated buyer. Filters are available to allow the user to include or exclude item commitments in specific states. A user can also retrieve item commitment(s) for a specific listing. Pagination parameters are also available that lets a user control the number of item commitments returned per page of results, and to retrieve a specific page of results based on a **pageCursor** value.
  
  Execution Errors:
  | Code                  |  Message                                                                     |
  |-----------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
