"""
This output type is used when an **itemCommitmentsByIds** query is partially successful, where one or more item commitments were successfully retrieved, but one or more other item commitments failed to be retrieved. The **itemCommitments** array will display all item commitments that were successfully retrieved, the **failures** array will show the identifiers of the item commitments that failed to be retrieved, and the error fields will provide more details on the issue(s) that caused the query to only be partially successful.
