  | INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR |  System failure.                                                             |
  """
  buyerOrders(input: OrdersInput!): PaginatedOrders! @authorize(scopes: ["https://api.ebay.com/oauth/api_scope/buy.order.read&eBayUser", "https://api.ebay.com/oauth/api_scope/buy.order&eBayUser"])
  """
