"""
The union type for the **processOrderInquiryRefund** mutation. This type covers two possible scenarios: success or failure. If the **processOrderInquiryRefund** mutation succeeds, the refund will be successfully processed. If the **processOrderInquiryRefund** mutation fails, an array of blocking errors detailing why the mutation failed will be returned, and the item commitment will not be created. If a mutation fails, there will always be at least one blocking error.
