  """
  listingTerms: ListingTerms
  """
  This container is applicable to multiple-variation listings, and provides details on the available product variations within the listing, and which traits are different for each of these variations. Products in a multiple-variation listing tend to vary by one or more traits such as color and size, and interested buyers need to select which variation they want to purchase. For example, the 'Blue, Large' t-shirt.
