- the rule cannot be enabled because one or more rule conditions are invalid
- the return rules feature is not enabled for the seller
"""
union UpdateSellerReturnRuleStatusOutput = ReturnResponseRule | ReturnRuleFeatureNotEnabledError | ReturnRuleNotFoundError | ReturnRuleStatusUpdateBlockedError | ReturnToAddressRule

"""
This input type defines the payload for the **updateSellerReturnToAddressRuleCondition** mutation, which creates a single automation return rule.

**Note:** The **ruleName** field is optional, but can be used to change the name of existing rule. If not provided, existing name will remain (unchanged).
"""
input UpdateSellerReturnToAddressRuleConditionInput {
