  """
  prioritizedRuleIds: [ID!]!
}

"""
This base response union type for the **updateSellerReturnToAddressRulesPriorities** mutation indicates whether the return-to-address automation rules were successfully reordered according to the priority specified in the input or if an error occurred that prevented its creation. It returns an error if:
