"""This interface represents a user's account type. """
interface UserAccountType {
  """
  The human-readable label for the user's account type.
     Every account type implementation has a display name under normal circumstances.
     A null response indicates an exceptional circumstance.
  **Note**: This value is for display purposes only.
  """
  displayName: String
}

"""
This type represents an account owned by a business entity. This indicates that the user's account is a business account.
"""
type UserAccountTypeBusiness implements UserAccountType {
  """
  The human-readable label for the user's account type. In this case, this field will return 'Business'.
  **Note**: This value is for display purposes only.	
  """
  displayName: String
}

"""
This type represents an account owned by an individual user. This indicates that the user's account is a individual account.
"""
type UserAccountTypeIndividual implements UserAccountType {
  """
  The human-readable label for the user's account type. In this case, this field will return 'Individual'.
  **Note**: This value is for display purposes only.	
  """
  displayName: String
}

"""
Represents a user's membership to an eBay program.

A membership record contains information about a user's subscription to
a specific eBay program (e.g., eBay Plus) on a particular site. Each
membership includes:
- The program name and site identifier
- Expiration date to track subscription validity

Examples of eBay membership programs:
- eBay Plus (premium membership with benefits like free shipping)
- Other subscription-based services across eBay's global marketplace
"""
type UserBenefitMembership {
  """
  Indicates when this membership expires. After this time:
  - The membership is considered expired
  - User may lose associated benefits
  - Membership may need to be renewed
  Format: ISO 8601 date-time string (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss.sssZ)
  Timezone: UTC
  """
  expiresAt: DateTime!
  """eBay marketplace site where this membership is valid."""
  membershipMarketplace: UserRegistrationMarketplace!
  """
  This field identifies which specific benefit program the membership record represents.
  Each program provides different benefits and features to subscribed users.
  """
  programType: UserBenefitMembershipType!
}

"""
eBay user benefit program types.
Represents the different membership and subscription programs offered by eBay
that provide special benefits and features to users.
"""
enum UserBenefitMembershipType {
  """
  eBay Plus premium membership program.
  
  A subscription-based program offering benefits such as:
  - Free shipping on eligible items
  - Free returns on eligible items
  - Exclusive deals and offers
  - Priority customer support
  """
  EBAY_PLUS
}

"""
Optional parameters that define a date range for which user bidding activity is being requested as well as how the returned data are organized.
