  The date and time the user saved this seller.
  **Format**: ISO 8601 date-time string ('YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss.sssZ')
  **Time zone**: UTC
  """
  savedAt: DateTime!
  """
  This container returns information about the saved seller, such as their ID and profile information.
  """
  seller: User!
}

"""
The base request type for the **userSavedSellers** query. This container is used to specify the sort order of the response, as well as specify pagination parameters for retrieving a user's saved sellers
**Note**: All parameters are optional. If not provided, default values will be used.
"""
input UserSavedSellersInput {
  """
  This container can be used to specify optional pagination settings that can be used to control page size and navigate through multiple pages of results. If pagination settings are not provided through this container, default pagination parameters will be applied.
  """
  pagination: PageInfoInput
  """
  This container is used to specify the sort order for the saved sellers query results.
  **Default value**: 'DATE_ADDED_DESC' (most recently added first)
  **Note**: When a cursor is provided in pagination, the sort order from the cursor takes precedence and this sort parameter is ignored.
  """
  sort: UserSavedSellersSort!
}

"""
This base response container for the **userSavedSellers** query. This type contains information about one or more of a user's saved sellers and includes paginated seller results, metadata about the collection, and navigation information.
"""
type UserSavedSellersOutput {
  """
  This container returns pagination information for navigating through multiple pages of saved sellers.
  """
